    {
      "id": "claim_8cb3e4b00f824e0895e33564bdf0635e",
      "statement": "The core package manifests declare different Python compatibility ranges: deepagents supports >=3.11,<4.0, deepagents-code >=3.12,<4.0, deepagents-acp >=3.11, deepagents-evals >=3.12,<3.14, and deepagents-talon >=3.12; therefore a compatible interpreter must be selected for the package being run, and evals excludes Python 3.14.",
